title: Appeal to the International
card-image: img/cards/international_relations.svg?v=2
subtitle: Foreign socialist pressure.
new-page: true
is-card: true
tags: party_affairs
view-if: player_party != 'lsr' and (international_relations_timer <= 0)
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; international_relations_timer = 6

Russia's socialist parties belong to the same International as the German SPD, the British Labour Party and the French SFIO. Their opinion matters, to somebody.

- @stockholm: Press for the Stockholm conference of socialists. (Only while the war lasts)
- @prisoners: Ask European socialists to protest the arrest of our comrades.
- @press: Send a delegate to the Western socialists.
- @aid: Appeal for money and paper.
- @easy_discard

@stockholm
view-if: at_war = 1
on-arrival: {!
Q.stockholm = (Q.stockholm || 0) + 1;
RO.add(Q, {war_weariness: -3, rel_kad: -3});
RO.boost(Q, {soldiers: 2, workers: 1});
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 2, -2);
RO.fac(Q, 'rightdef', 0, 3);
!}

The Soviet has invited the European socialists to meet in Stockholm to find a common peace programme. The Allied governments refuse passports. [? if stockholm >= 3 : The conference is now a real prospect. ?]

@prisoners
view-if: bol_regime = 1
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {repression: -3});
if (Q.legality <= 1 && Q.stockholm_ok) { Q.legality += 0; }
RO.fac(Q, 'intl', 1, -2);
Q.foreign_pressure = (Q.foreign_pressure || 0) + 1;
!}

A telegram from the Second International and a letter from the British Labour Party made it harder for the authorities to ignore the arrests.

@press
on-arrival: {!
RO.add(Q, {soviet_democracy: 1});
Q.resources += 1;
RO.fac(Q, 'defencist', 1, -1);
!}

Axelrod, in Europe since August 1917, lobbied socialist parties on our behalf. He is the party's best-known name abroad.

@aid
on-arrival: {!
Q.resources += 2;
RO.fac(Q, 'unions', 0, 1);
!}

The European socialist press raised some money for us. It is not much, but it comes in foreign currency.
